<title>UK: Sino Land sets $130 mln convertible bond.</title>
<headline>Sino Land sets $130 mln convertible bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Flemings.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SINO LAND</p>
<p> AMT   *$130 MLN	COUPON     4.0	 MATURITY  **18.APR.02</p>
<p> TYPE  CONVERTIBLE    ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    18.APR.97</p>
<p> DENOMS (K) ONE	 SALE LIMITS US/UK/HKPAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> FIXED FOREX	    HK$7.749/US$	SHARES PER BOND  911.65</p>
<p>CONVERSION PERIOD 18.JUN.97-11.APR.02  REDEMPTION PRICE 131 PCT CONVERSION PRICE  HK$8.50 - A 15.02 PCT PREMIUM OVER EX DIV</p>
<p>			 FIVE DAY AVERAGE OR 17.24 PCT PREMIUM OVER</p>
<p>			 CLOSING SHARE PRICE.</p>
<p>NOTES:</p>
<p>CONVERTIBLE INTO SHARES OF SINO LAND.</p>
<p>*PLUS $35 MILLION MANAGERS OPTION.</p>
<p>**HARD NON CALL FOR THREE YEARS, THEREAFTER CALLABLE AT ACCRETED</p>
<p>VALUE SUBJECT 135.0 PCT RULE.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
